<div aria-hidden="true" class="worldbook-app" id="worldbookApp">
<div class="worldbook-shell">
<header class="worldbook-head">
<button aria-label="返回桌面" class="ph-btn js-worldbook-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<div class="worldbook-head-copy">
<h1 class="worldbook-title">世界书</h1>
<p id="worldbookSubtitle">管理 AI 世界设定</p>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-head-actions">
<button aria-label="导入世界书" class="worldbook-import-btn" id="worldbookImportBtn" title="导入 JSON / ZIP" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.9" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 15.5V4.2"></path><path d="M7.8 8.4 12 4.2l4.2 4.2"></path><path d="M4.5 15.5v2.8a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7 1.7h11.6a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7-1.7v-2.8"></path></svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="新建世界书" class="worldbook-new-btn" id="worldbookNewBtn" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg>
</button>
</div>
<input accept=".json,.zip,application/json,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed,multipart/x-zip" hidden="" id="worldbookImportFileInput" type="file"/>
</header>
<main class="worldbook-body">
<section class="worldbook-list-view" id="worldbookListView">
<div class="worldbook-intro">
<span class="worldbook-eyebrow">WORLD BOOK</span>
<h2>把世界写下来</h2>
<p>角色、地点、规则、历史，都可以收进一本世界书。</p>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-list" id="worldbookList"></div>
</section>
<section class="worldbook-detail-view" hidden="" id="worldbookDetailView">
<div class="worldbook-detail-hero">
<div class="worldbook-detail-hero-main">
<div class="worldbook-detail-badge" id="worldbookDetailBadge">书</div>
<div class="worldbook-detail-copy">
<span class="worldbook-eyebrow">WORLD BOOK</span>
<h2 id="worldbookDetailName">未命名世界</h2>
<p id="worldbookDetailDescription">还没有简介。</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-detail-actions">
<button class="worldbook-detail-edit" id="worldbookEditBtn" type="button">编辑</button>
<button class="worldbook-detail-delete" id="worldbookDeleteBtn" type="button">删除世界书</button>
</div>
</div> <div class="worldbook-detail-card">
<div class="worldbook-detail-card-head">
<div>
<span class="worldbook-eyebrow">ENTRIES</span>
<strong id="worldbookEntryCount">0 条设定</strong>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-card-actions">
<button class="worldbook-entry-import" id="worldbookEntryImportBtn" type="button">导入文件</button>
<button class="worldbook-entry-add" id="worldbookEntryAddBtn" type="button">＋ 新建条目</button>
</div>
</div>
<input accept=".txt,.md,.markdown,.docx,.json,.jsonl,text/plain,text/markdown,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document,application/json,application/x-ndjson" hidden="" id="worldbookEntryFileInput" type="file"/>
<div class="worldbook-entry-list" id="worldbookEntryList"></div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-empty" id="worldbookEntryEmpty">
<div class="worldbook-entry-dot"></div>
<div>
<strong>还没有世界书条目</strong>
<span>把角色、地点、规则等设定写成条目，并用关键词控制何时注入。</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-mask" id="worldbookEditorMask"></div>
<section aria-labelledby="worldbookEditorTitle" aria-modal="true" class="worldbook-sheet" id="worldbookEditorSheet" role="dialog">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="worldbook-sheet-grab"></div>
<div class="worldbook-sheet-head">
<div>
<span class="worldbook-eyebrow">WORLD BOOK</span>
<h2 id="worldbookEditorTitle">新建世界书</h2>
</div>
<button aria-label="关闭" class="worldbook-sheet-close" id="worldbookEditorClose" type="button">×</button>
</div>
<label class="worldbook-field">
<span>名称</span>
<input autocomplete="off" id="worldbookNameInput" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：星海纪元" type="text"/>
</label>
<label class="worldbook-field">
<span>简介 <em>可选</em></span>
<textarea id="worldbookDescriptionInput" maxlength="300" placeholder="一句话描述这个世界的基调、时代与核心规则。" rows="4"></textarea>
</label>
<div class="worldbook-mount-section">
<div class="worldbook-mount-head">
<div>
<span class="worldbook-mount-label">挂载范围</span>
<small>决定这本世界书会在哪些聊天里注入 AI 上下文</small>
</div>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-segment worldbook-mount-segment" id="worldbookMountScopeSegment">
<button class="is-active" data-worldbook-scope="global" type="button">全局</button>
<button data-worldbook-scope="local" type="button">局部</button>
</div>
<label class="worldbook-mount-target" id="worldbookMountTargetWrap">
<span>局部角色</span>
<select aria-label="选择局部挂载角色" id="worldbookMountTarget"></select>
</label>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-sheet-actions">
<button class="worldbook-cancel-btn" id="worldbookEditorCancel" type="button">取消</button>
<button class="worldbook-save-btn" disabled="" id="worldbookEditorSave" type="button">创建世界书</button>
</div>
</section>
<div class="worldbook-entry-mask" id="worldbookEntryEditorMask"></div>
<section aria-labelledby="worldbookEntryEditorTitle" aria-modal="true" class="worldbook-entry-sheet" id="worldbookEntryEditorSheet" role="dialog">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="worldbook-sheet-grab"></div>
<div class="worldbook-sheet-head">
<div>
<span class="worldbook-eyebrow">ENTRY</span>
<h2 id="worldbookEntryEditorTitle">新建条目</h2>
</div>
<button aria-label="关闭" class="worldbook-sheet-close" id="worldbookEntryEditorClose" type="button">×</button>
</div>
<label class="worldbook-field">
<span>条目名称</span>
<input autocomplete="off" id="worldbookEntryNameInput" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：帝国首都" type="text"/>
</label>
<label class="worldbook-field">
<span>关键词 <em>多个关键词用逗号、空格或换行分隔</em></span>
<input autocomplete="off" id="worldbookEntryKeywordsInput" maxlength="300" placeholder="帝都, 首都, 皇城" type="text"/>
</label>
<label class="worldbook-field">
<span>内容</span>
<textarea id="worldbookEntryContentInput" maxlength="6000" placeholder="写下这条设定。AI 被注入世界书时会读取这里的内容。" rows="7"></textarea>
</label>
<div class="worldbook-entry-settings">
<div class="worldbook-entry-setting">
<span class="worldbook-setting-label">触发方式</span>
<div class="worldbook-segment" id="worldbookEntryModeSegment">
<button class="is-active" data-entry-mode="always" type="button">常驻</button>
<button data-entry-mode="keyword" type="button">关键词触发</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-setting">
<span class="worldbook-setting-label">优先级 <em>数字越大越优先</em></span>
<input class="worldbook-priority-input" id="worldbookEntryPriorityInput" inputmode="numeric" max="999" min="0" step="1" type="number" value="100"/>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-setting">
<span class="worldbook-setting-label">插入位置 <em>控制条目进入 AI 上下文的位置</em></span>
<div class="worldbook-segment worldbook-position-segment" id="worldbookEntryPositionSegment">
<button data-entry-position="highest" type="button">最高</button>
<button data-entry-position="front" type="button">前</button>
<button class="is-active" data-entry-position="middle" type="button">中</button>
<button data-entry-position="back" type="button">后</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-setting worldbook-entry-toggle-row">
<div>
<span class="worldbook-setting-label">启用条目</span>
<small>停用后不会被世界书选择逻辑使用</small>
</div>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="worldbook-toggle is-on" id="worldbookEntryEnabledToggle" type="button"><span></span></button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="worldbook-entry-actions">
<button class="worldbook-cancel-btn" id="worldbookEntryEditorCancel" type="button">取消</button>
<button class="worldbook-save-btn" disabled="" id="worldbookEntryEditorSave" type="button">保存条目</button>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="settings-app" id="settingsApp">
<div class="settings-shell">
<div class="settings-body">
<section class="settings-panel is-active" data-panel="main">
<header class="panel-head">
<button aria-label="返回桌面" class="ph-btn js-settings-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<h1 class="ph-title">设置</h1>
<div class="ph-actions"></div>
</header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="settings-section-title">AI</div>
<div class="me-menu">
<button class="me-item" id="gotoApi" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5v3M12 17.5v3M20.5 12h-3M6.5 12h-3 M18.1 5.9l-2.1 2.1M8 16l-2.1 2.1 M18.1 18.1l-2.1-2.1M8 8 5.9 5.9"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4"></circle></svg>
<span>AI 接口</span>
<span class="me-state" id="apiState">未配置</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="gotoSecondaryApi" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5v3M12 17.5v3M20.5 12h-3M6.5 12h-3 M18.1 5.9l-2.1 2.1M8 16l-2.1 2.1 M18.1 18.1l-2.1-2.1M8 8 5.9 5.9"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4"></circle></svg>
<span>副API</span>
<span class="me-state" id="secondaryApiState">未配置</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="gotoVectorMemoryApi" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.8"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="7" r="1.8"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="18" r="1.8"></circle><path d="m7.6 7 8.7-1.1M7 7.4l.7 8.8M9.7 17l6.8-8.7"></path></svg>
<span>向量记忆 API</span><span class="me-state" id="vectorMemoryApiState">未配置</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="gotoVectorRerankApi" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 7h14M5 12h10M5 17h6"></path><path d="m17 10 3 2-3 2"></path></svg>
<span>重排 API</span><span class="me-state" id="vectorRerankApiState">未配置</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="gotoStt" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v5.2a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V6.5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M6.5 11.4a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 11 0M12 16.9v3.6M9.2 20.5h5.6"></path></svg>
<span>语音转文字</span>
<span class="me-state" id="sttState">未配置</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">系统</div>
<div class="me-menu">
<button class="me-item" id="openAppearance" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0 17z" fill="currentColor" opacity=".25"></path></svg>
<span>外观</span>
<span class="me-state theme-state" id="themeState">跟随系统</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="openFonts" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18.5 10.8 5.5h2.4L18 18.5"></path><path d="M8.4 13h7.2"></path></svg>
<span>字体</span>
<span class="me-state" id="fontState">跟随系统</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" data-me="通知" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 10a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0c0 4 1.5 5.5 1.5 5.5H5S6.5 14 6.5 10z"></path><path d="M10 18.5a2.2 2.2 0 0 0 4 0"></path></svg>
<span>通知</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="openIslandStorage" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6.5" rx="7.5" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M4.5 6.5v11c0 1.7 3.4 3 7.5 3s7.5-1.3 7.5-3v-11"></path><path d="M4.5 12c0 1.7 3.4 3 7.5 3s7.5-1.3 7.5-3"></path></svg>
<span>数据与储存</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<button class="me-item" id="openIslandAbout" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 11v5.5"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" fill="currentColor" r=".9" stroke="none"></circle></svg>
<span>关于 岛屿</span>
<svg class="chev" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5"></path></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">数据备份</div>
<div class="backup-full-card">
<div class="backup-full-copy">
<strong>完整备份</strong>
<span>一次导出或恢复岛屿的全部本地数据</span>
</div>
<div class="backup-full-actions">
<button class="backup-action-btn" id="importBackupBtn" type="button">导入</button>
<button class="backup-action-btn primary" id="exportBackupBtn" type="button">导出</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title backup-subtitle">分别备份</div>

<div class="backup-batch-toolbar">
<div class="backup-batch-selection"><span id="backupPartSelectionCount">已选 0 / 9 项</span><button class="backup-batch-link" id="backupPartSelectAllBtn" type="button">全选</button></div>
<div class="backup-batch-actions">
<button class="backup-action-btn" id="backupPartBatchImportBtn" type="button">多选导入</button>
<button class="backup-action-btn primary" disabled="" id="backupSelectedExportBtn" type="button">导出已选</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-menu">
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择系统设置" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="settings"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>系统设置</strong><span>主题、API、通知、字体等设置</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="settings" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="settings" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择聊天" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="chats"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>聊天</strong><span>聊天列表与所有聊天记录</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="chats" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="chats" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择通讯录" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="contacts"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>通讯录</strong><span>联系人、联系人资料与状态</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="contacts" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="contacts" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择动态" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="moments"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>动态</strong><span>动态内容、点赞与互动数据</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="moments" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="moments" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择电话记录" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="phoneCalls"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>电话记录</strong><span>语音通话会话与通话索引</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="phoneCalls" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="phoneCalls" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择记忆" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="memory"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>记忆</strong><span>短期记忆、重要记忆与总结记录</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="memory" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="memory" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择角色人设" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="personas"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>角色人设</strong><span>角色、角色头像与角色设定</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="personas" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="personas" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择我的身份" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="userPersonas"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>我的身份</strong><span>自己的身份卡与头像</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="userPersonas" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="userPersonas" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择世界书" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="worldbooks"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>世界书</strong><span>世界书、条目与规则</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="worldbooks" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="worldbooks" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
<div class="backup-part-item">
<label aria-label="选择表情包" class="backup-part-check">
<input class="js-backup-part-select" type="checkbox" value="stickers"/>
<span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
<div class="backup-part-copy"><strong>表情包</strong><span>表情包分组与本地表情数据</span></div>
<div class="backup-part-actions"><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-import" data-backup-part="stickers" type="button">导入</button><button class="backup-action-btn js-backup-export" data-backup-part="stickers" type="button">导出</button></div>
</div>
</div>
<input accept="application/json,.json" hidden="" id="backupFileInput" type="file"/>
<input accept="application/json,.json" hidden="" id="backupPartFileInput" type="file"/>
<input accept=".json,.zip,application/json,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed" hidden="" id="backupPartBatchFileInput" multiple="" type="file"/>
<div style="height: 30px"></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="fonts">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-fonts-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">字体</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="settings-section-title">当前字体</div>
<div class="appearance-menu font-current-menu">
<div class="appearance-row"><div class="appearance-copy"><strong id="fontCurrentName">跟随系统</strong><em id="fontCurrentSource">跟随手机系统字体</em></div><button class="appearance-upload-btn" disabled="" id="fontSystemBtn" type="button">已启用</button></div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">字体大小与粗细</div>
<div class="font-tune-menu">
<label class="font-tune-row">
<span class="font-tune-copy"><strong>字体大小</strong><em>全局界面文字</em></span>
<input class="font-range" id="fontSizeRange" max="120" min="85" step="5" type="range" value="100"/>
<span class="font-tune-value" id="fontSizeValue">100%</span>
</label>
<label class="font-tune-row">
<span class="font-tune-copy"><strong>字体粗细</strong><em>整体字重</em></span>
<input class="font-range" id="fontWeightRange" max="700" min="300" step="25" type="range" value="400"/>
<span class="font-tune-value" id="fontWeightValue">400</span>
</label>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">导入 TTF</div>
<div class="appearance-menu">
<div class="appearance-upload" style="border-top:0"><div class="appearance-upload-copy"><strong>本地 TTF 字体</strong><em id="fontFileState">选择一个 .ttf 文件并保存在本机</em></div><button class="appearance-upload-btn" id="fontFileBtn" type="button">导入字体</button><input accept=".ttf,font/ttf" hidden="" id="fontFileInput" type="file"/></div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">字体链接</div>
<div class="appearance-menu font-link-menu">
<label class="font-link-field"><span>TTF / 字体文件链接</span><input autocomplete="off" id="fontUrlInput" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://example.com/font.ttf" spellcheck="false" type="url"/></label>
<div class="font-link-actions"><button class="api-btn secondary" id="fontUrlAddBtn" type="button">添加字体</button></div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">我的字体</div>
<div class="font-library" id="fontLibrary"><div class="font-library-empty">还没有导入自定义字体。</div></div>
<div style="height:30px"></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="notifications">
<header class="panel-head">
<button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-notification-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<h1 class="ph-title">通知</h1>
<div class="ph-actions"></div>
</header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="settings-section-title">角色消息</div>
<div class="appearance-menu notification-menu">
<button aria-checked="false" class="appearance-row" id="notificationEnabledToggle" role="switch" type="button">
<span class="appearance-copy"><strong>接收角色主动消息</strong><em id="notificationEnabledHint">关闭</em></span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span>
</button>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主动消息频率</div>
<div class="appearance-menu notification-menu">
<label class="notification-field"><span>最短间隔</span><select id="notificationMinInterval"><option value="30">30 分钟</option><option value="60">1 小时</option><option value="120">2 小时</option><option value="240">4 小时</option></select></label>
<label class="notification-field"><span>最长间隔</span><select id="notificationMaxInterval"><option value="60">1 小时</option><option value="120">2 小时</option><option value="240">4 小时</option><option value="480">8 小时</option><option value="720">12 小时</option></select></label>
<label class="notification-field"><span>静默开始</span><input id="notificationQuietStart" type="time" value="23:00"/></label>
<label class="notification-field"><span>静默结束</span><input id="notificationQuietEnd" type="time" value="08:00"/></label>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">系统权限</div>
<div class="appearance-menu notification-menu">
<div class="notification-status-row"><span>通知权限</span><strong id="notificationPermissionState">未检查</strong></div>
<div class="notification-actions"><button class="appearance-upload-btn" id="notificationPermissionBtn" type="button">允许通知</button><button class="appearance-upload-btn" id="notificationTestBtn" type="button">发送测试通知</button></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="storage">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-storage-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">数据与储存</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="settings-section-title">岛屿 储存</div>
<div class="storage-summary">
<div class="storage-summary-main"><div><div class="storage-usage" id="storageUsage">0 B</div><div style="margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:var(--fg-faint)">当前可识别的 岛屿 数据</div></div><div class="storage-quota" id="storageQuota">浏览器存储：读取中</div></div>
<div class="storage-bar"><i id="storageBar"></i></div>
<div class="storage-meta"><div><strong id="storageItemCount">0</strong><span>数据项</span></div></div>
</div>
<div class="storage-actions"><button class="api-btn secondary" id="refreshStorage" type="button">刷新</button><button class="api-btn secondary" id="clearIslandCache" type="button">清理空数据</button></div>
<div class="settings-section-title">储存内容</div>
<div class="storage-list" id="storageList"><div class="storage-empty">正在读取 岛屿 数据…</div></div>
<div style="height:30px"></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="about">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-about-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">关于 岛屿</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="about-hero">
<div class="about-mark">M</div>
<div><strong>岛屿</strong><span>更新日志</span></div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">每次更新</div>
<div class="changelog" data-changelog-source="changelog.json" id="islandChangelog"></div>
<div class="about-footer">岛屿 · Personal AI · Changelog</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="appearance">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-appearance-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">外观</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="settings-section-title">系统主题</div><div class="theme-menu" id="themeMenu">
<button aria-checked="false" class="theme-option" data-theme-choice="system" role="radio" type="button"><span class="theme-option-main"><strong>跟随系统</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span></button>
<button aria-checked="false" class="theme-option" data-theme-choice="light" role="radio" type="button"><span class="theme-option-main"><strong>日间</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span></button>
<button aria-checked="false" class="theme-option" data-theme-choice="dark" role="radio" type="button"><span class="theme-option-main"><strong>夜间</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span></button>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">系统状态栏</div><div class="theme-menu"><button aria-checked="true" class="theme-option statusbar-option" id="statusBarToggle" role="switch" type="button"><span class="theme-option-main"><strong>岛屿 状态栏</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="statusbar-switch"></span></button></div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主屏幕 · 图标</div><div class="appearance-menu">
<div class="appearance-row"><div class="appearance-copy"><strong>图标主题</strong><em>统一调整桌面 App 图标的视觉语言</em></div></div><div class="appearance-options"><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-theme="mono" type="button">Mono</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-theme="solid" type="button">实心</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-theme="outline" type="button">线框</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-theme="glass" type="button">玻璃</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-theme="borderless" type="button">无边框</button></div>
<div class="appearance-row"><div class="appearance-copy"><strong>图标形状</strong><em>方形、柔和圆角、圆形或胶囊</em></div></div><div class="appearance-options"><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-shape="square" type="button">方形</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-shape="soft" type="button">圆角</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-shape="round" type="button">圆形</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-shape="pill" type="button">胶囊</button></div>
<div class="appearance-row"><div class="appearance-copy"><strong>图标尺寸</strong><em>调整主屏幕与 Dock 中图标的整体比例</em></div></div><div class="appearance-options"><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-size="small" type="button">小</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-size="medium" type="button">中</button><button class="appearance-pill" data-home-icon-size="large" type="button">大</button></div>
<button aria-checked="true" class="appearance-row" id="homeIconLabelsToggle" role="switch" type="button"><span class="appearance-copy"><strong>显示图标名称</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span></button>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主屏幕 · 壁纸</div><div class="appearance-menu"><div class="appearance-upload" style="border-top:0"><div class="appearance-upload-copy"><strong>本地图片壁纸</strong><em id="wallpaperState">未选择本地图片</em></div><button class="appearance-upload-btn" id="wallpaperUploadBtn" type="button">导入图片</button><input accept="image/*" hidden="" id="wallpaperInput" type="file"/></div></div><div class="appearance-menu"><button aria-checked="true" class="appearance-row" id="dimDarkWallpaperToggle" role="switch" type="button"><span class="appearance-copy"><strong>夜间压暗壁纸与本地图标</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="appearance-switch"></span></button></div><div class="dark-dim-menu">
<div class="dark-dim-row">
<strong class="dark-dim-label">夜间壁纸图片压暗程度</strong>
<strong class="dark-dim-value" id="dimDarkWallpaperAmountValue">42%</strong>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="dark-dim-lock" id="dimDarkWallpaperLock" type="button">锁定</button>
<input aria-label="夜间壁纸压暗程度" class="dark-dim-range" id="dimDarkWallpaperAmount" max="100" min="0" step="1" type="range" value="42"/>
</div>
<div class="dark-dim-divider"></div>
<div class="dark-dim-row">
<strong class="dark-dim-label">夜间本地图标图片压暗程度</strong>
<strong class="dark-dim-value" id="dimDarkIconAmountValue">42%</strong>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="dark-dim-lock" id="dimDarkIconLock" type="button">锁定</button>
<input aria-label="夜间本地图标压暗程度" class="dark-dim-range" id="dimDarkIconAmount" max="100" min="0" step="1" type="range" value="42"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主屏幕 · Dock</div><div class="appearance-menu dock-settings-menu">
<div class="dock-control-row"><span class="dock-control-label">圆角</span><input aria-label="Dock圆角" class="dock-control-range" id="dockRadiusRange" max="40" min="0" step="1" type="range" value="5"/><strong class="dock-control-value" id="dockRadiusValue">5px</strong><button aria-pressed="false" class="dock-control-lock" id="dockRadiusLock" type="button">锁定</button></div>
<div class="dock-control-divider"></div>
<div class="dock-control-row"><span class="dock-control-label">透明度</span><input aria-label="Dock透明度" class="dock-control-range" id="dockTransparencyRange" max="100" min="0" step="1" type="range" value="0"/><strong class="dock-control-value" id="dockTransparencyValue">0%</strong><button aria-pressed="false" class="dock-control-lock" id="dockTransparencyLock" type="button">锁定</button></div>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主屏幕 · 默认小组件</div><div class="widget-library" id="widgetLibrary">
<article class="widget-card" data-widget-card="time"><div class="widget-card-head"><div class="widget-card-copy"><strong>时间</strong><em>岛屿 默认时间组件</em></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="widget-toggle"></span></div></article>
<article class="widget-card" data-widget-card="music"><div class="widget-card-head"><div class="widget-card-copy"><strong>音乐</strong><em>岛屿 默认音乐组件</em></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="widget-toggle"></span></div></article>
</div>
<div class="settings-section-title">主屏幕 · 应用图标</div><div class="icon-library" id="iconLibrary"></div>
<div style="height:30px"></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="api">
<header class="panel-head">
<button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-api-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<h1 class="ph-title">AI 接口</h1>
<div class="ph-actions"></div>
</header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="api-form">
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">快捷预设</span></div>
<div class="chips" id="presetChips">
<button class="chip" data-preset="openai" type="button">OpenAI</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="deepseek" type="button">DeepSeek</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="kimi" type="button">Kimi</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="zhipu" type="button">智谱 GLM</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="silicon" type="button">硅基流动</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="openrouter" type="button">OpenRouter</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="custom" type="button">自定义</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">快捷预设只用于快速填充接口和模型；下面的已保存预设会连同 API Key、温度一起切换。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field saved-preset-field">
<div class="api-field-head">
<span class="api-label">已保存预设</span>
<span class="api-preset-actions">
<button class="api-hint-btn" id="apiNewPreset" type="button">＋新建预设</button>
<button class="api-hint-btn" disabled="" id="apiUpdatePreset" type="button">更新当前</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="saved-preset-list" id="savedPresetList"></div>
<div class="api-hint" id="savedPresetHint">还没有保存的预设。填写下面的接口信息后，点击“＋新建预设”。选择已有预设后可编辑下面的接口信息，再点击“更新当前”覆盖该预设。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">Base URL</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="apiBaseUrl" placeholder="https://api.openai.com/v1" spellcheck="false" type="url"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint" id="apiUrlHint">填写中转站的接口地址。若以 /v1 结尾会自动补 /chat/completions，其他情况补 /v1/chat/completions。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">API Key</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap has-eye">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="apiKey" placeholder="sk-…" spellcheck="false" type="password"/>
<button aria-label="显示 / 隐藏" class="api-eye" id="apiKeyEye" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.5 12S6 5.5 12 5.5 21.5 12 21.5 12 18 18.5 12 18.5 2.5 12 2.5 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">仅保存在本机 IndexedDB，不会上传到任何服务器。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head">
<span class="api-label">模型</span>
<button class="api-hint-btn" id="apiFetchModels" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4.5V10h-5.5"></path></svg>
                  拉取模型
                </button>
</div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="apiModel" placeholder="gpt-4o-mini" spellcheck="false" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint" id="apiModelHint">如 gpt-4o-mini、deepseek-chat、moonshot-v1-8k、glm-4-flash 等。点右上角可直接拉取该站支持的模型列表。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">温度</span></div>
<div class="api-slider-row">
<input class="api-slider" id="apiTemp" max="2" min="0" step="0.05" type="range" value="0.85"/>
<span class="api-slider-value" id="apiTempVal">0.85</span>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">越高越有创造力，越低越稳定。角色扮演建议 0.8 ~ 1.1。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">最大回复长度（tokens）</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input class="api-input" id="apiMaxTokens" inputmode="numeric" max="32000" min="0" placeholder="0 = 不限制" step="64" type="number"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">留空或 0 表示不传该字段，由服务端决定。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-actions">
<button class="api-btn secondary" id="apiTest" type="button">测试连接</button>
<button class="api-btn primary" id="apiSave" type="button">保存</button>
</div>
<div class="api-status" id="apiStatus"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="settings-panel" data-panel="stt">
<header class="panel-head">
<button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-stt-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<h1 class="ph-title">语音转文字</h1>
<div class="ph-actions"></div>
</header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="api-form">
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">快捷预设</span></div>
<div class="chips" id="sttPresetChips">
<button class="chip" data-preset="openai" type="button">OpenAI</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="custom" type="button">自定义</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">这里独立配置“语音 → 文字”的识别服务，不使用聊天 AI 接口。默认按 OpenAI-compatible 的音频转写协议调用。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">Base URL</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="sttBaseUrl" placeholder="https://api.openai.com/v1" spellcheck="false" type="url"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint" id="sttUrlHint">填写 API 根地址。若以 /v1 结尾，会自动请求 /audio/transcriptions。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">API Key</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap has-eye">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="sttApiKey" placeholder="sk-…" spellcheck="false" type="password"/>
<button aria-label="显示 / 隐藏" class="api-eye" id="sttApiKeyEye" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.5 12S6 5.5 12 5.5 21.5 12 21.5 12 18 18.5 12 18.5 2.5 12 2.5 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">仅保存在本机 IndexedDB；真正识别时音频会直接从当前设备请求到这里。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head">
<span class="api-label">识别模型</span>
<button class="api-hint-btn" id="sttFetchModels" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4.5V10h-5.5"></path></svg>
                  拉取模型
                </button>
</div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="sttModel" placeholder="gpt-4o-mini-transcribe" spellcheck="false" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">推荐选择服务端明确标注为 Speech-to-Text / Transcribe 的模型。模型列表不会自动筛选，以兼容不同中转站。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">语言</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<select class="api-input api-select" id="sttLanguage">
<option value="auto">自动识别</option>
<option value="zh">中文</option>
<option value="en">English</option>
<option value="ja">日本語</option>
<option value="ko">한국어</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">有明确语言时建议指定 ISO-639-1 代码，通常能减少识别延迟并提高准确度。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">提示词（可选）</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<textarea autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="sttPrompt" placeholder="例如：角色名有“林澈”“小岛”；专有名词尽量保留原写法。" rows="3" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">可放人名、术语、品牌名等，帮助模型理解上下文；不填写时不会上传 prompt 字段。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-actions">
<button class="api-btn secondary" id="sttTest" type="button">测试接口</button>
<button class="api-btn primary" id="sttSave" type="button">保存</button>
</div>
<div class="api-status" id="sttStatus"></div>
<div class="api-hint stt-note">识别请求使用 multipart/form-data 上传当前录音。浏览器 / APK WebView 必须允许麦克风，并且你的 STT 服务需要允许当前页面的跨域请求（CORS）。</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="settings-panel" data-panel="secondaryApi">
<header class="panel-head">
<button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-secondary-api-back" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg>
</button>
<h1 class="ph-title">副API</h1>
<div class="ph-actions"></div>
</header>
<div class="panel-scroll">
<div class="api-form">
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">快捷预设</span></div>
<div class="chips" id="secondaryPresetChips">
<button class="chip" data-preset="openai" type="button">OpenAI</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="deepseek" type="button">DeepSeek</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="kimi" type="button">Kimi</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="zhipu" type="button">智谱 GLM</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="silicon" type="button">硅基流动</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="openrouter" type="button">OpenRouter</button>
<button class="chip" data-preset="custom" type="button">自定义</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">副API独立保存，与主API互不影响；已保存预设会连同 API Key、温度一起切换。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field saved-preset-field">
<div class="api-field-head">
<span class="api-label">已保存预设</span>
<span class="api-preset-actions">
<button class="api-hint-btn" id="secondaryNewPreset" type="button">＋新建预设</button>
<button class="api-hint-btn" disabled="" id="secondaryUpdatePreset" type="button">更新当前</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="saved-preset-list" id="secondarySavedPresetList"></div>
<div class="api-hint" id="secondarySavedPresetHint">还没有保存的预设。填写下面的接口信息后，点击“＋新建预设”。选择已有预设后可编辑下面的接口信息，再点击“更新当前”覆盖该副API预设。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">Base URL</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="secondaryApiBaseUrl" placeholder="https://api.openai.com/v1" spellcheck="false" type="url"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint" id="secondaryApiUrlHint">填写中转站的接口地址。若以 /v1 结尾会自动补 /chat/completions，其他情况补 /v1/chat/completions。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">API Key</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap has-eye">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="secondaryApiKey" placeholder="sk-…" spellcheck="false" type="password"/>
<button aria-label="显示 / 隐藏" class="api-eye" id="secondaryApiKeyEye" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.5 12S6 5.5 12 5.5 21.5 12 21.5 12 18 18.5 12 18.5 2.5 12 2.5 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">仅保存在本机 IndexedDB，不会上传到任何服务器。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head">
<span class="api-label">模型</span>
<button class="api-hint-btn" id="secondaryApiFetchModels" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4.5V10h-5.5"></path></svg>
                  拉取模型
                </button>
</div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="secondaryApiModel" placeholder="gpt-4o-mini" spellcheck="false" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint" id="secondaryApiModelHint">如 gpt-4o-mini、deepseek-chat、moonshot-v1-8k、glm-4-flash 等。点右上角可直接拉取该站支持的模型列表。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">温度</span></div>
<div class="api-slider-row">
<input class="api-slider" id="secondaryApiTemp" max="2" min="0" step="0.05" type="range" value="0.85"/>
<span class="api-slider-value" id="secondaryApiTempVal">0.85</span>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">越高越有创造力，越低越稳定。角色扮演建议 0.8 ~ 1.1。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-field">
<div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">最大回复长度（tokens）</span></div>
<div class="api-input-wrap">
<input class="api-input" id="secondaryApiMaxTokens" inputmode="numeric" max="32000" min="0" placeholder="0 = 不限制" step="64" type="number"/>
</div>
<div class="api-hint">留空或 0 表示不传该字段，由服务端决定。</div>
</div>
<div class="api-actions">
<button class="api-btn secondary" id="secondaryApiTest" type="button">测试连接</button>
<button class="api-btn primary" id="secondaryApiSave" type="button">保存</button>
</div>
<div class="api-status" id="secondaryApiStatus"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="settings-panel" data-panel="vectorMemoryApi">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-vector-memory-api-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">向量记忆 API</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll"><div class="api-form">
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">接口地址</span></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="vectorEmbeddingApiBaseUrl" placeholder="https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings" spellcheck="false" type="url"/></div><div class="api-hint" id="vectorEmbeddingApiUrlHint">可填写完整 /embeddings 地址；若填写到 /v1，系统会自动补 /embeddings。</div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">API Key</span></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocomplete="off" class="api-input" id="vectorEmbeddingApiKey" placeholder="sk-…" type="password"/></div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">Embedding 模型</span><button class="api-hint-btn" id="vectorEmbeddingFetchModels" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4.5V10h-5.5"></path></svg>拉取模型</button></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="vectorEmbeddingApiModel" placeholder="text-embedding-3-small"/></div><div class="api-hint">支持返回 OpenAI 风格 <code>/models</code> 列表的服务；模型列表不会强制筛选，可兼容中转站和自建接口。</div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">召回参数</span></div><div class="vector-memory-setting-grid"><label><span>最终条数</span><input class="api-input" id="vectorMemoryTopK" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="30" type="number" value="8"/></label><label><span>候选条数</span><input class="api-input" id="vectorMemoryCandidateK" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="100" type="number" value="24"/></label><label><span>相似度阈值</span><input class="api-input" id="vectorMemorySimilarityThreshold" inputmode="decimal" min="-1" max="1" step="0.01" type="number" value="0.18"/></label></div><div class="api-hint">先从向量库取候选，再可调用重排 API；候选数量应大于等于最终条数。</div></div>
<div class="api-actions"><button class="api-btn secondary" id="vectorEmbeddingApiTest" type="button">测试连接</button><button class="api-btn primary" id="vectorEmbeddingApiSave" type="button">保存设置</button></div>
<div class="api-status" id="vectorEmbeddingApiStatus"></div>
</div></div>
</section>
<section class="settings-panel" data-panel="vectorRerankApi">
<header class="panel-head"><button aria-label="返回设置" class="ph-btn js-vector-rerank-api-back" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5.5 8.5 12 15 18.5"></path></svg></button><h1 class="ph-title">重排 API</h1><div class="ph-actions"></div></header>
<div class="panel-scroll"><div class="api-form">
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">接口地址</span></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="vectorRerankApiBaseUrl" placeholder="https://your-rerank-service/v1/rerank" spellcheck="false" type="url"/></div><div class="api-hint" id="vectorRerankApiUrlHint">支持常见 rerank 接口：POST {model, query, documents, top_n}，兼容 /rerank 结尾地址。</div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">API Key</span></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocomplete="off" class="api-input" id="vectorRerankApiKey" placeholder="sk-…" type="password"/></div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-field-head"><span class="api-label">重排模型</span><button class="api-hint-btn" id="vectorRerankFetchModels" type="button"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4.5V10h-5.5"></path></svg>拉取模型</button></div><div class="api-input-wrap"><input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" class="api-input" id="vectorRerankApiModel" placeholder="BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3"/></div><div class="api-hint">支持返回 OpenAI 风格 <code>/models</code> 列表的服务；模型列表不会强制筛选，便于兼容不同 Rerank 服务。</div></div>
<div class="api-field"><div class="api-note-card">聊天时会把向量召回的候选记忆交给该接口重新排序；未配置重排 API 时，系统自动使用向量相似度排序，不影响基本功能。</div></div>
<div class="api-actions"><button class="api-btn secondary" id="vectorRerankApiTest" type="button">测试连接</button><button class="api-btn primary" id="vectorRerankApiSave" type="button">保存设置</button></div>
<div class="api-status" id="vectorRerankApiStatus"></div>
</div></div>
</section>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sheet-mask high" id="modelMask"></div>
<div aria-label="选择模型" aria-modal="true" class="model-sheet" id="modelSheet" role="dialog">
<div class="model-sheet-head">
<div class="model-sheet-title">选择模型<span class="model-sheet-count" id="modelCount"></span></div>
<button class="model-sheet-close" id="modelSheetClose" type="button">关闭</button>
</div>
<div class="model-search">
<input autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" id="modelSearchInput" placeholder="搜索模型…" spellcheck="false" type="search"/>
</div>
<div class="model-list" id="modelList"></div>
</div>
<div class="sheet-mask" id="sheetMask"></div>
<div aria-label="添加人设" aria-modal="true" class="sheet" id="sheet" role="dialog">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="sheet-grab"></div>
<h2>添加人设</h2>
<div class="upload-row">
<button aria-label="上传头像" class="avatar-upload" id="avatarUploadBtn" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="13" rx="4" width="17" x="3.5" y="5.5"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2"></circle><path d="M8.5 5.5 9.7 3.6h4.6l1.2 1.9"></path></svg>
<img alt="" hidden="" id="avatarPreview"/>
</button>
<div class="upload-info">
<div class="upload-title">头像</div>
<div class="upload-desc">点击左侧从本地选择图片<br/>支持 JPG / PNG / WebP，建议小于 4MB</div>
</div>
<button class="upload-clear" hidden="" id="avatarClearBtn" type="button">移除</button>
</div>
<label class="field-label" for="newName">名字</label>
<input autocomplete="off" class="field" id="newName" maxlength="12" placeholder="给 TA 起个名字" type="text"/>
<div class="gender-field">
<div class="gender-field-label">性别</div>
<div aria-label="角色性别" class="gender-options" id="personaGenderOptions" role="radiogroup">
<button aria-checked="true" class="gender-option is-selected" data-persona-gender="unspecified" role="radio" type="button">不设置</button>
<button aria-checked="false" class="gender-option" data-persona-gender="male" role="radio" type="button">男</button>
<button aria-checked="false" class="gender-option" data-persona-gender="female" role="radio" type="button">女</button>
<button aria-checked="false" class="gender-option" data-persona-gender="nonbinary" role="radio" type="button">非二元</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field-row">
<label class="field-label" for="newDesc">人设描述</label>
<button class="import-btn" id="importFileBtn" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.9" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 15.5V4.2"></path><path d="M7.8 8.4 12 4.2l4.2 4.2"></path><path d="M4.5 15.5v2.8a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7 1.7h11.6a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7-1.7v-2.8"></path></svg>
      从文件导入
    </button>
</div>
<textarea class="field" id="newDesc" placeholder="性格、说话风格、背景设定…
也可以从本地 .txt / .md / .json 文件导入"></textarea>
<button class="sheet-submit" disabled="" id="createPersona" type="button">创建人设</button>
<input accept="image/*" hidden="" id="avatarInput" type="file"/>
<input accept=".txt,.md,.markdown,.json,.text,text/plain,text/markdown,application/json" hidden="" id="personaFileInput" type="file"/>
</div>
<div class="sheet-mask" id="userSheetMask"></div>
<div aria-label="我的角色" aria-modal="true" class="sheet" id="userSheet" role="dialog">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="sheet-grab"></div>
<h2 id="userSheetTitle">添加我的角色</h2>
<div class="upload-row">
<button aria-label="上传头像" class="avatar-upload" id="userAvatarUploadBtn" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="13" rx="4" width="17" x="3.5" y="5.5"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2"></circle><path d="M8.5 5.5 9.7 3.6h4.6l1.2 1.9"></path></svg>
<img alt="" hidden="" id="userAvatarPreview"/>
</button>
<div class="upload-info">
<div class="upload-title">头像</div>
<div class="upload-desc">点击左侧从本地选择图片<br/>支持 JPG / PNG / WebP，建议小于 4MB</div>
</div>
<button class="upload-clear" hidden="" id="userAvatarClearBtn" type="button">移除</button>
</div>
<label class="field-label" for="userName">名字</label>
<input autocomplete="off" class="field" id="userName" maxlength="12" placeholder="你在这个世界里的名字" type="text"/>
<div class="field-row">
<label class="field-label" for="userDesc">描述</label>
<button class="import-btn" id="userImportFileBtn" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.9" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 15.5V4.2"></path><path d="M7.8 8.4 12 4.2l4.2 4.2"></path><path d="M4.5 15.5v2.8a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7 1.7h11.6a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.7-1.7v-2.8"></path></svg>
      从文件导入
    </button>
</div>
<textarea class="field" id="userDesc" placeholder="你的身份、性格、和角色之间的关系…
也可以从本地 .txt / .md / .json 文件导入"></textarea>
<div class="sheet-actions" id="userSheetActions">
<button class="api-btn secondary" id="deleteUserPersona" type="button">删除</button>
<button class="api-btn secondary" id="setUserPersonaActive" type="button">设为当前使用</button>
</div>
<button class="sheet-submit" disabled="" id="createUserPersona" type="button">创建我的角色</button>
<input accept="image/*" hidden="" id="userAvatarInput" type="file"/>
<input accept=".txt,.md,.markdown,.json,.text,text/plain,text/markdown,application/json" hidden="" id="userPersonaFileInput" type="file"/>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
<script defer="" src="./assets/js/jszip.min.js"></script>
<script defer="" src="./assets/js/han-pinyin-initials.js"></script>
<script defer="" src="./assets/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
